WEBVTT

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.857
Burn to a crisp, you puny human brat!

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:26.484
Guns N' Ro!

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:02.455
Oh?

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.999
No. That son of a bitch!

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.668
He can use the same spell.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:11.172
So it seems you know
a little bit of magic, do you?

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.591
This is bad.

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:16.052
My vision is blurry from the poison.

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:23.476
Clerics and wizards
use four different types of magic.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.271
These categories are based
on the source of it's power.

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:32.026
The first type is magic based
on mental strength and life force.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.528
The second type is white magic,

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:36.656
which gets its power
from faith in the gods.

00:02:36.739 --> 00:02:38.658
The third type is dark magic,

00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:41.578
which comes from making a pact
with a demon in Hell.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.913
And the last type is spirit magic.

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.291
Oh? Aren't you a smart one.

00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:47.792
So knowledgable.

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:50.920
Spirit magic is based on forming a pact

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:54.090
with spirits that live
in the four elemental planes,

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.843
earth, fire, water, wind.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:59.929
Dark Schneider mainly uses
that and dark magic.

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:01.723
His specialty is lightning magic,

00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:04.225
which comes from the wind elemental plane,

00:03:04.309 --> 00:03:08.229
and flame magic,
which comes from the fire elemental plane.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.900
Efreet comes from
the fire elemental plane.

00:03:11.983 --> 00:03:15.361
Can you guess what that means
for Dark Schneider, young lady?

00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:16.821
Oh no.

00:03:16.905 --> 00:03:17.947
That's right!

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:21.951
If he uses any of his fire spells,
his most powerful magic,

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:24.787
there's no way
he'll be able to stop Efreet.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.331
And that's not all.

00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:27.790
If he tries to use Hellion,

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:31.211
it will only boost
the flame god's power more.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:36.216
What's wrong, human?
Am I too strong for you?

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.178
Dark Schneider, are you okay?

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:42.513
No. This isn't good.

00:03:43.181 --> 00:03:45.016
It's so hot!

00:03:45.099 --> 00:03:48.811
It's at least twice as hot
as my own Guns N' Ro spell!

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.730
I need you to stay close to me!

00:03:50.813 --> 00:03:54.275
The flames outside this barrier
are over 1,000 degrees!

00:03:54.359 --> 00:03:56.194
They'll turn you to ash!

00:03:57.779 --> 00:04:01.199
Well, I've heard of a spell
that might be able to help you.

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:05.203
It's one that can damage inhabitants
of the fire elemental plane.

00:04:05.286 --> 00:04:07.413
All right. Tell me this spell of yours.

00:04:07.497 --> 00:04:09.374
-Okay. It's a Cold spe--!
-Nope.

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:12.293
What?

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:14.671
I don't have that spell.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:17.340
I never cared much
for the cooling element.

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:21.010
But you know,
Kall-Su was good at those.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.471
No way! Then what can you do?

00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:29.018
You call yourself a wizard,
but you don't even know a Cold spell?

00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:31.562
Shut up, you stupid monster!

00:04:31.646 --> 00:04:34.148
Humans all have
their own strengths and weaknesses!

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:36.693
They also love to make excuses.

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:37.944
No matter.

00:04:38.027 --> 00:04:42.365
I'm going to turn that fire magic strength
of yours against you!

00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:46.119
His flame attack will be hotter
than 2,000 degrees.

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:50.290
This room's about
to turn into a sea of magma!

00:04:50.373 --> 00:04:51.582
I call upon…

00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:54.127
This barrier won't protect both of us.

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:57.422
You can wait for me here.

00:04:57.505 --> 00:05:00.008
What are you doing?
You can't leave me!

00:05:00.591 --> 00:05:02.677
Let's go, you monster!

00:05:05.221 --> 00:05:07.348
Die, human!

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:09.100
Hellion Flame!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.271
Dark Schneider!

00:05:15.565 --> 00:05:17.525
It seems the fight has begun.

00:05:18.693 --> 00:05:20.111
<i>Did Lucien really…</i>

00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:24.115
<i>I-if he's here,</i>
<i>then how did they break the seal?</i>

00:05:24.699 --> 00:05:27.910
<i>I-I mean,</i>
<i>did some other woman kiss Lucien?</i>

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:30.913
<i>No. Who could have done that?</i>

00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:34.459
Hey! This way!

00:05:34.542 --> 00:05:36.544
This wall has been destroyed as well.

00:05:36.627 --> 00:05:38.338
Hmm.

00:05:38.421 --> 00:05:39.922
It must've been him.

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:41.674
He's incredibly strong.

00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:44.010
So this is the power of magic.

00:05:45.094 --> 00:05:46.888
It's so hot in here.

00:05:47.388 --> 00:05:50.433
We need to find
the source of that rumbling. Stay focused!

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.518
Hey! Look!
What's that over there?

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:55.229
What the hell is going on?

00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:57.523
Is that magma?

00:06:00.943 --> 00:06:02.779
Have you gone mad, human?

00:06:03.279 --> 00:06:06.366
Are you hoping to get burned
to death, you puny imbecile?

00:06:06.949 --> 00:06:10.370
The measly life of a human goes by
in the blink of an eye.

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:12.705
And you decided to throw yours away!

00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:13.831
What a fool!

00:06:13.915 --> 00:06:15.541
No!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.838
Brain, brain, now you're brain-dead.

00:06:20.922 --> 00:06:21.756
What the…

00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:25.176
Are you really trying
to cast a spell from within the fire?

00:06:25.259 --> 00:06:26.761
He's doing it!

00:06:26.844 --> 00:06:28.930
Obey our covenant of blood.

00:06:29.013 --> 00:06:30.973
Come forth from the land of Abbadon…

00:06:31.641 --> 00:06:32.642
No.

00:06:32.725 --> 00:06:34.685
No way you're using that spell!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.729
That idiot!

00:06:37.313 --> 00:06:38.815
Stop this, human!

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.442
Fire magic won't work
against the likes of me!

00:06:41.526 --> 00:06:45.780
Gehenna flames, form a fiery blast
and burn through all before me!

00:06:45.863 --> 00:06:47.740
Hmm? I said it won't work!

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:50.034
Go, Exodus!

00:06:51.035 --> 00:06:52.412
No way!

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:56.124
Bastard! How did you do this?

00:06:56.207 --> 00:07:00.086
It's over 20,000 degrees,
hotter than the melting point of rock!

00:07:00.169 --> 00:07:04.257
I used the super-high temperature flames
and added my spell on top.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.342
For someone with my magic power level,

00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:07.885
it was no sweat at all.

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:09.011
Die, demon!

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:11.848
You used
my Hellion spell to help you?

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:13.266
There's no way!

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:18.813
So you've arrived, Dark Schneider.

00:07:26.904 --> 00:07:28.448
Dammit!

00:07:28.531 --> 00:07:31.451
I can't believe he used
an extra-hot flame spell

00:07:31.534 --> 00:07:34.787
to slay the demon god of fire himself!

00:07:40.835 --> 00:07:45.715
This is the only time I've actually lost,
ever since I was born…

00:07:46.757 --> 00:07:49.260
…over 300 years ago.

00:07:49.719 --> 00:07:51.596
You're a damn punk.

00:07:51.679 --> 00:07:54.599
You liked
to keep calling me a little human,

00:07:54.682 --> 00:07:56.350
but you're even younger than me.

00:08:02.857 --> 00:08:05.276
Efreet went back into the sword!

00:08:05.359 --> 00:08:06.611
He's admitted defeat!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.740
No one has ever been able
to beat the Fire Sword.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:14.452
Gara couldn't get his hands
on that magical object.

00:08:14.535 --> 00:08:17.038
The sword has accepted a new owner.

00:08:18.289 --> 00:08:20.166
The Fire Sword, huh?

00:08:20.249 --> 00:08:23.085
I am a wizard, though.
I don't need a sword.

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:26.297
This will never be as good as Exodus.

00:08:27.089 --> 00:08:29.717
Gara, let's go!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.469
Give me my woman!

00:08:31.552 --> 00:08:33.804
Run!
He's gonna use the sword!

00:08:38.267 --> 00:08:40.394
Very well done, Dark Schneider.

00:08:40.478 --> 00:08:43.856
Long time no see. It's been 15 years.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.026
Uh, Lucien!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.447
<i>It's you. You really came to save me.</i>

00:08:52.615 --> 00:08:53.908
<i>I can't believe it.</i>

00:08:54.659 --> 00:08:55.493
<i>Lucien…</i>

00:08:56.118 --> 00:08:58.788
<i>I-I mean, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:01.707
Gara. You little bitch.

00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:06.003
I'm very impressed you were able
to vanquish Efreet, Dark Schneider.

00:09:06.087 --> 00:09:09.715
Now I understand how you were able
to gain an army of ten million,

00:09:09.799 --> 00:09:13.678
and how you almost conquered
the entire world with them.

00:09:13.761 --> 00:09:16.180
However…

00:09:16.264 --> 00:09:18.724
…you've had to use up
a great deal of magic

00:09:18.808 --> 00:09:20.893
to get this far, haven't you?

00:09:20.977 --> 00:09:23.271
And that's not all. You've been poisoned.

00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:25.314
Your body and your mind
have reached their limit.

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:26.857
You're at your breaking point.

00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:28.317
<i>Poisoned?</i>

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:30.361
She's a sweet girl, isn't she?

00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:32.196
Since you came all this way to save her,

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.615
I assume you must have a thing for her.

00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:36.617
I'm shocked you haven't touched her.

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:38.911
Now, that's not like you, is it?

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:43.833
You're evil,
cruel, cunning, and cold-hearted.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:47.003
You'd do anything to win,
no matter how low you sank.

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:48.838
They all feared you like a demon.

00:09:50.214 --> 00:09:53.092
And yet somehow,
you let a sweet thing like this tame you.

00:09:53.175 --> 00:09:54.093
Let go!

00:09:54.176 --> 00:09:55.678
Son of a bitch!

00:09:56.178 --> 00:09:58.347
You ripped off her dress, didn't you?

00:09:59.515 --> 00:10:01.809
That's not for your eyes!

00:10:01.892 --> 00:10:02.768
Hmm?

00:10:03.352 --> 00:10:05.021
That's so unfair!

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:07.857
I haven't even seen her yet!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.358
-Huh?
-Uh…

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:13.112
You pervert!

00:10:13.195 --> 00:10:14.238
How dare you!

00:10:14.322 --> 00:10:17.575
I can't believe I was actually starting
to have feelings for you!

00:10:19.118 --> 00:10:22.580
You're not anything
like the man I remember.

00:10:23.581 --> 00:10:24.790
Oh, well.

00:10:24.874 --> 00:10:27.918
Why don't we have a battle
with our swords and magic?

00:10:28.002 --> 00:10:30.212
Will the magician say his spell first,

00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:32.673
or will the swordsman land the first blow?

00:10:32.757 --> 00:10:35.301
-Master Gara!
-Please, stay back!

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.762
Just five minutes.

00:10:37.845 --> 00:10:42.391
That's all the time I'll need to show you
how good I've gotten in 15 years.

00:10:42.975 --> 00:10:44.435
Great idea.

00:10:44.518 --> 00:10:46.771
Come over here and let me kill you.

00:10:49.899 --> 00:10:51.192
Thought you'd never ask!

00:10:51.275 --> 00:10:53.069
Murasame Blade!

00:10:57.281 --> 00:10:59.241
Yes! Master Gara!

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:01.160
See that?

00:11:01.243 --> 00:11:05.081
I could still attack even when I'm not
within your striking range!

00:11:09.085 --> 00:11:10.711
Okay. That hurt.

00:11:12.046 --> 00:11:14.006
Give me all you got, Dark Schneider!

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:16.384
Let's see that powerful spell of yours!

00:11:21.931 --> 00:11:25.685
<i>A wizard is just a normal human</i>
<i>if he can't say a spell.</i>

00:11:25.768 --> 00:11:28.729
<i>There's no way he'll be able</i>
<i>to beat a ninja without it.</i>

00:11:31.732 --> 00:11:34.360
Yoko, I hope that you weren't hurt.

00:11:34.443 --> 00:11:35.528
Princess…

00:11:35.611 --> 00:11:38.322
<i>Uh, what is she doing here?</i>

00:11:38.406 --> 00:11:39.657
Don't worry.

00:11:40.157 --> 00:11:42.743
I'm certain that he'll defeat him.

00:11:42.827 --> 00:11:44.912
<i>No way.</i>

00:11:44.995 --> 00:11:47.206
<i>Could Sheila be the one who…</i>

00:12:00.177 --> 00:12:05.391
Zaazard, Zaazard. Schrono, Chronossk.

00:12:05.474 --> 00:12:09.103
That spell. He's using Venom!

00:12:09.186 --> 00:12:12.565
Oh, flames of hell,
burning in the depths of darkness…

00:12:12.648 --> 00:12:14.775
<i>That's right, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:12:14.859 --> 00:12:17.528
<i>That's the only spell you have left.</i>

00:12:17.611 --> 00:12:19.488
<i>But you're too late!</i>

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:21.490
He won't make it
before he finishes!

00:12:21.574 --> 00:12:22.450
Master Gara!

00:12:22.533 --> 00:12:25.286
…act as my sword and slay my enemies!

00:12:25.369 --> 00:12:26.787
Majinken!

00:12:33.043 --> 00:12:34.420
Dark Schneider!

00:12:34.503 --> 00:12:36.630
He did it! Master Gara won!

00:12:37.214 --> 00:12:38.090
Hmm.

00:12:40.885 --> 00:12:42.803
Venom!

00:12:43.679 --> 00:12:44.555
What?

00:12:44.638 --> 00:12:45.973
No! No!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.480
Master Gara!

00:12:54.482 --> 00:12:55.733
<i>That was close.</i>

00:12:55.816 --> 00:12:59.737
<i>If I had blocked that any later, that</i>
<i>Venom spell would've been a direct hit.</i>

00:13:00.946 --> 00:13:02.114
Gara,

00:13:02.698 --> 00:13:05.576
you are really underestimating me.

00:13:05.659 --> 00:13:07.620
Don't you know who I am?

00:13:07.703 --> 00:13:10.581
Why not take a look
at what I did to your body?

00:13:11.832 --> 00:13:14.084
You destroyed my arm.

00:13:14.168 --> 00:13:15.419
Bastard!

00:13:16.003 --> 00:13:18.172
Now I'm gonna kill you!

00:13:18.255 --> 00:13:19.548
Whoa!

00:13:19.632 --> 00:13:21.217
They're going all out now.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.511
They're really going to kill each other!

00:13:23.594 --> 00:13:28.015
No! If Dark Schneider's magic
and Master Gara's sword clash head-on,

00:13:28.098 --> 00:13:29.725
all of us are going to die!

00:13:31.936 --> 00:13:35.189
B-but does Dark Schneider
have any spells left

00:13:35.272 --> 00:13:37.399
that are strong enough
to beat Master Gara?

00:13:45.866 --> 00:13:47.993
<i>He's bleeding so much.</i>

00:13:48.994 --> 00:13:52.414
I've only got a spell or two left
to use for when I fight Gara.

00:13:52.498 --> 00:13:55.251
It'll just barely be enough
to beat that asshole.

00:13:56.168 --> 00:13:58.754
<i>And he's been poisoned,</i>

00:13:59.296 --> 00:14:01.632
<i>but he's still willing</i>
<i>to fight to protect her.</i>

00:14:03.801 --> 00:14:05.886
<i>Does he really love Yoko that much?</i>

00:14:06.512 --> 00:14:08.889
<i>My heart, it aches.</i>

00:14:09.473 --> 00:14:10.850
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:14:13.561 --> 00:14:15.354
<i> Princess Sheila?</i>

00:14:17.982 --> 00:14:19.024
<i>Hold on.</i>

00:14:19.567 --> 00:14:23.320
<i>Is Princess Sheila</i>
<i>in love with Lucien too?</i>

00:14:23.821 --> 00:14:25.489
<i>How is that possible?</i>

00:14:27.575 --> 00:14:29.535
<i>Why does he fight?</i>

00:14:30.035 --> 00:14:31.996
<i>He doesn't have any spells left.</i>

00:14:32.079 --> 00:14:35.291
<i>Even if he did,</i>
<i>he'd pass out from losing so much blood.</i>

00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:38.252
<i>This fight should be over</i>
<i>with my next strike.</i>

00:14:39.336 --> 00:14:41.297
<i>But he's still so intimidating.</i>

00:14:42.006 --> 00:14:43.132
<i>All right.</i>

00:14:43.632 --> 00:14:47.511
Dark Schneider!
You really are the best sorcerer.

00:14:47.595 --> 00:14:50.264
However,
you don't have any spells left, do you?

00:14:50.347 --> 00:14:53.183
But you don't have to get so worked up.

00:14:53.267 --> 00:14:55.811
Were you really that upset about the girl?

00:14:55.895 --> 00:14:57.938
She's not so special.

00:14:58.022 --> 00:14:58.856
What?

00:14:58.939 --> 00:15:00.274
Oh, right. I get it.

00:15:00.357 --> 00:15:02.234
I forgot you like virgins.

00:15:03.944 --> 00:15:07.406
Do you want to know what I did
to this sweet young thing?

00:15:08.574 --> 00:15:11.327
You little bitch! What did you do to Yoko?

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.662
Okay. I'll tell.

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:16.415
First,
I tied her up nice and tight in chains,

00:15:16.498 --> 00:15:18.667
then I had fun covering her in slime.

00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:21.378
Y-you covered her in slime?

00:15:21.462 --> 00:15:23.756
Hey! Stop it!
He doesn't need to hear this!

00:15:23.839 --> 00:15:26.717
I melted her clothes, got her naked,

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.803
and licked every corner of her body,

00:15:29.887 --> 00:15:31.639
nice and slow.

00:15:31.722 --> 00:15:34.350
Wait. Nice and slow, licking…

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:36.977
He's lying! Shut up! Shut up right now!

00:15:37.561 --> 00:15:40.981
And then I took out
my well-toned Utamaro Sword,

00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:43.067
dunked it in a simmering hot oil,

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.444
and pushed it in and out of its sheath,

00:15:45.527 --> 00:15:47.947
and slowly split her open in two.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:50.783
Split her open?

00:15:50.866 --> 00:15:53.410
Gara! None of this actually happened!

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:55.621
I took her completely!

00:15:55.704 --> 00:15:57.623
She really was a virgin!

00:15:59.124 --> 00:16:01.752
Her body was absolutely perfect!

00:16:02.836 --> 00:16:04.213
Whoa!

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:08.258
Why you… I'm going to kill you!

00:16:08.342 --> 00:16:11.470
They're lies!
Everything he said is a lie!

00:16:11.553 --> 00:16:13.472
Gara, shut up! He's lying!

00:16:13.555 --> 00:16:14.682
Uh… oh!

00:16:16.058 --> 00:16:16.934
Mmm?

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:22.982
<i> How about that, Dark Schneider?</i>

00:16:23.065 --> 00:16:25.025
<i>Do you still care about her?</i>

00:16:25.109 --> 00:16:27.194
<i>Do we even feel like fighting anymore?</i>

00:16:27.277 --> 00:16:32.074
Gara. You asshole!

00:16:32.574 --> 00:16:35.953
I'm going to kill you!

00:16:36.704 --> 00:16:38.706
Oh, spirits of the earth and the air,

00:16:38.789 --> 00:16:42.918
I summon you to do your duty
and fulfill our ancient pact!

00:16:44.878 --> 00:16:47.381
That spell is legendary!

00:16:48.257 --> 00:16:49.383
You idiot!

00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:52.636
Your body won't be able
to handle another one of my spells.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.388
Take this! Kyukyoku Ougi!

00:16:54.471 --> 00:16:56.098
Megadeath!

00:16:56.181 --> 00:16:58.058
Shin-Majinken!

00:16:58.142 --> 00:16:59.518
Perish, Dark Schneider!

00:16:59.601 --> 00:17:02.062
Both you and your legend should die out!

00:17:07.484 --> 00:17:08.652
What?

00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:11.488
<i>Shin-Majinken is faster</i>
<i>than the speed of sound,</i>

00:17:11.572 --> 00:17:13.198
<i>but he blocked it with one arm!</i>

00:17:14.491 --> 00:17:15.868
Earthquake!

00:17:17.494 --> 00:17:21.498
The magic of the spirits
of the earth and the sky is resonating!

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:27.046
When the strong magic of these two
different elements fuse together,

00:17:27.129 --> 00:17:29.465
it will create a tremendous force field!

00:17:29.548 --> 00:17:33.802
And I'll use this spell
to blow up the whole castle!

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:37.556
Gara! This is what true power really is!

00:17:45.022 --> 00:17:46.940
Destroy it! Destroy it!

00:17:47.024 --> 00:17:50.194
Bring this whole castle to the ground!

00:17:55.991 --> 00:17:58.619
Huh? It's a barrier.

00:18:01.163 --> 00:18:02.831
Princess!

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.386
Hey, Gara. You dead?

00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:18.680
You bastard.

00:18:18.764 --> 00:18:21.141
I thought you didn't have any spells left.

00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:22.601
You're a liar.

00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:24.937
You idiot!
You can't write a shonen manga

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:27.648
if you care too much
about the foreshadowing making sense.

00:18:27.731 --> 00:18:30.109
I mean, you're the one
who made me mad enough

00:18:30.192 --> 00:18:31.401
to have the power to do that,

00:18:31.485 --> 00:18:34.738
so how's it feel
to know all of this is your fault?

00:18:35.364 --> 00:18:37.991
You know,
sometimes you really piss me off.

00:18:38.075 --> 00:18:40.244
And what the hell's going on
with your arm?

00:18:40.327 --> 00:18:42.287
It's not attached right.

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:46.542
I'm not sure body parts
are supposed to pop on and off like that.

00:18:46.625 --> 00:18:47.793
It freaks me out.

00:18:47.876 --> 00:18:50.254
Anyway, doesn't matter anymore.

00:18:50.838 --> 00:18:51.922
You know what I mean?

00:18:52.673 --> 00:18:54.842
I like how laid back you are.

00:18:55.342 --> 00:18:57.094
Despite me just kicking your ass.

00:18:59.555 --> 00:19:02.474
So you think I've changed?
Do you think I'm soft?

00:19:02.558 --> 00:19:04.393
-Mm-hmm.
-Hmm?

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:07.729
You sure are different
from how you used to be.

00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:10.440
You would have never said
anything like that back then.

00:19:11.275 --> 00:19:12.359
Really?

00:19:13.193 --> 00:19:16.029
Wait. Oh no! Where's Lars!

00:19:16.113 --> 00:19:19.116
I forgot all about Lars! Lars!

00:19:19.616 --> 00:19:20.993
Huh?

00:19:25.706 --> 00:19:26.540
Here.

00:19:26.623 --> 00:19:28.125
Huh?

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:30.627
So Lars belongs with you, right?

00:19:30.711 --> 00:19:32.129
Huh? Yeah.

00:19:34.673 --> 00:19:36.216
So you're okay.

00:19:36.717 --> 00:19:38.719
The barrier protected him,

00:19:38.802 --> 00:19:40.387
along with the two of us.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:41.305
What?

00:19:41.388 --> 00:19:43.015
Hmm?

00:19:43.098 --> 00:19:46.518
<i>How'd he have any strength leftover</i>
<i>to do that?</i>

00:19:46.602 --> 00:19:48.604
<i>Seems he really has changed.</i>

00:19:49.188 --> 00:19:53.025
<i>The old Dark Schneider wouldn't have</i>
<i>hesitated to have killed me and Lars!</i>

00:19:55.444 --> 00:19:56.528
Hmm.

00:19:57.654 --> 00:20:00.073
I lost fair and square to you.

00:20:00.574 --> 00:20:02.451
Nothing is making sense anymore.

00:20:04.036 --> 00:20:05.704
<i>What a strange man.</i>

00:20:06.205 --> 00:20:07.915
<i>He tried to kill his enemy,</i>

00:20:07.998 --> 00:20:10.876
<i>but he still chose</i>
<i>to protect his enemy's loved one.</i>

00:20:10.959 --> 00:20:13.712
<i>Dark Schneider, who are you?</i>

00:20:13.795 --> 00:20:15.881
Oh, good! It still works!

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:26.308
Hmm?

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:29.061
Uh…

00:20:30.354 --> 00:20:32.147
Okay, okay. I get it.

00:20:32.231 --> 00:20:35.192
Thank you for coming
to rescue me, Dark Schneider.

00:20:35.275 --> 00:20:36.318
Is that it?

00:20:36.818 --> 00:20:38.237
There's nothing else?

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.782
You were pretty cool.

00:20:46.828 --> 00:20:47.746
Uh…

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.083
You know,
even though you're no longer a virgin,

00:20:51.166 --> 00:20:52.459
I still love you.

00:20:53.126 --> 00:20:53.961
Huh?

00:20:58.173 --> 00:20:59.716
Really. I mean that.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.052
I don't care if I'm not your first.

00:21:02.135 --> 00:21:03.387
What was that?

00:21:04.429 --> 00:21:06.181
You perverted sorcerer!

00:21:06.265 --> 00:21:08.725
Oh, why are all you men such sleazeballs?

00:21:08.809 --> 00:21:09.893
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.977 --> 00:21:13.188
And also, you better tell me
who broke your seal this time around!

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:14.856
Oh, yeah. About that…

00:21:16.525 --> 00:21:19.361
Are you actually scared
of getting beaten up by a girl?

00:21:19.444 --> 00:21:22.239
Shut up! See?
This is why I didn't want to come!

00:21:22.322 --> 00:21:24.908
I'll have you know
I'm still a virgin, you idiot!

00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:26.410
D-did you just call me…

00:21:26.493 --> 00:21:28.078
Did you just say I'm an idiot?

00:21:28.161 --> 00:21:30.205
I said you're an idiot
because you're an idiot!

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:32.916
<i>There's no room</i>
<i>for me in this conversation.</i>

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.751
If anyone an idiot, it's you!

00:21:34.835 --> 00:21:36.378
Princess!

00:21:36.461 --> 00:21:38.088
Princess!

00:21:38.171 --> 00:21:40.757
Everyone, you're all safe!

00:21:45.554 --> 00:21:49.933
By the way, as we speak,
your country, Meta-llicana,

00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:53.270
is being attacked
by the Third Unit from my Rebel Army.

00:21:53.353 --> 00:21:54.855
What are you gonna do about it?

00:21:55.439 --> 00:21:57.065
What?

00:21:57.149 --> 00:21:59.359
This was an obvious distraction.

00:21:59.443 --> 00:22:01.528
I mean,
you can see what I'm working with here.

00:22:04.448 --> 00:22:06.325
Why are you acting like you don't care?

00:22:06.408 --> 00:22:07.993
Because I don't care.

00:22:08.076 --> 00:22:10.370
You haven't changed at all,
Dark Schneider.

00:22:12.539 --> 00:22:14.916
You haven't forgotten who I am, have you?

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.502
That would hurt my feelings.
